    {
      "id": "vrHtNHcEimeGrzfpMcTCv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 336.17787339952264,
      "y": 215.02223714192706,
      "width": 605.5195922851562,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1952227981,
      "version": 411,
      "versionNonce": 2025751555,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784525623383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. User should be able to search for neaby places using \n    a. Search Radius\n        * 500m\n        * 1Km\n        * 5Km\n        * 10Km\n    b. Category Filter\n\n2. Support Incremental Loading\n\n3. Results should be sorted by:\n    * Distance\n    * Relevance\n    * Popularity\n    * Rating\n\n4. Provide CRUD for POI\n    updates are relatively infrequent compared to read traffic \n    can be eventual consisitent",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. User should be able to search for neaby places using \n    a. Search Radius\n        * 500m\n        * 1Km\n        * 5Km\n        * 10Km\n    b. Category Filter\n\n2. Support Incremental Loading\n\n3. Results should be sorted by:\n    * Distance\n    * Relevance\n    * Popularity\n    * Rating\n\n4. Provide CRUD for POI\n    updates are relatively infrequent compared to read traffic \n    can be eventual consisitent",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
